POSSIBLE CLASS RELATIONSHIPS

1. Book, Magazine and CD inherit from Product.
2. PersonalCustomer and BusinessCustomer inherit
   from Customer.
3. Customer places Orders.
4. Order contains Products.
5. Order may require multiple Shipments.
6. Customer makes Payments.
7. BusinessCustomer receives Invoices.

